  "body": "In particular, it looks to me like at call-time the `getElementsByTagName` call captures the HTML-ness of _root_'s node document at the time it's called.  So if that HTML-ness changes, a new object needs to be returned.\n\nI put a testcase at http://web.mit.edu/bzbarsky/www/testcases/dom-queries/test_getElementsByTagName_1.html which tries to exercise some of the edge-cases here.\n",
